emqx_gateway_api_authn.add_authn.desc = "Enables the authenticator for client authentication for the specified gateway. <br/>\nWhen the authenticator is not configured or turned off, all client connections are assumed to be allowed. <br/>\nNote: Only one authenticator is allowed to be enabled at a time in the gateway, rather than allowing multiple authenticators to be configured to form an authentication chain as in MQTT."
